    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You are so attuned to the wind patterns of your world that you can detect subtle shifts in air pressure around you.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kel_Dor\" title=\"Kel Dor\">Kel Dor</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b>&nbsp;You ignore <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cover\" title=\"Cover\">Cover</a> for the purposes of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks against targets within 10 squares of you.</p>",
